WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:18.801
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:23.585
So, what's this guy's story?

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:26.866
He came here and he died. The end.

00:00:26.866 --> 00:00:27.801
Nrgh!

00:00:30.599 --> 00:00:31.843
Uh...

00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:34.262
I think I'm in the wrong place?

00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:36.000
This isn't--Ow! Fuck...

00:00:36.927 --> 00:00:41.615
Don't distract me! I've got...
other... things on my mind.

00:00:41.615 --> 00:00:44.599
Would it be too much to ask for
this thing to ignore me?

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:46.167
Yeah, yeah it would.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.599
That should scare it off, huh?

00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:53.923
Maybe I killed it. It's just
limping its final moments now.

00:00:53.923 --> 00:00:56.901
No, that's not really limping,
huh? This should help.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:58.767
Bye!

00:00:59.461 --> 00:01:00.676
Did I miss?

00:01:00.676 --> 00:01:02.267
Here, let's do this right.

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.901
I cannot think of a better use...

00:01:06.214 --> 00:01:07.807
There we go!

00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:09.767
But, just in case... let me in!

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:10.293
Le--

00:01:10.293 --> 00:01:13.982
[screaming]

00:01:13.982 --> 00:01:14.959
I'M FREAKING OUT!

00:01:14.959 --> 00:01:16.545
I'M FREAKING OUT! I LIED!

00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:17.874
I'M FREAKING OUT!

00:01:17.874 --> 00:01:20.486
DIE! DIE! DIE!

00:01:20.486 --> 00:01:21.800
DIE AGAIN!

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.977
DIE MORE!

00:01:22.977 --> 00:01:24.445
[The Gonarch squeals]

00:01:24.445 --> 00:01:26.634
Wihhhh-oooooooooo!

00:01:27.872 --> 00:01:29.820
YOUR TERMS ARE UNACCEPTABLE!

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:30.601
WAH!

00:01:32.283 --> 00:01:37.234
AND QUIT SHOOTING YOUR WHITE...
SPIDER-WEB... HELL MILK!

00:01:39.112 --> 00:01:40.259
[The Gonarch squeals]

00:01:40.259 --> 00:01:41.885
Mroooooowwwwwww...

00:01:41.885 --> 00:01:43.747
[The Gonarch cries]

00:01:43.747 --> 00:01:46.784
Mrraaaaaaaaa...

00:01:48.099 --> 00:01:49.685
[The Gonarch cries]

00:01:49.685 --> 00:01:52.000
Mrraaaaaa...

00:01:53.482 --> 00:01:54.156
Ow!

00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:56.298
THANK YOU FOR YOUR INPUT!

00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:58.218
THAT'S VERY INSIGHTFUL!

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.267
I DON'T KNOW WHAT
I WOULD DO WITHOUT IT!

00:02:01.194 --> 00:02:02.467
WHERE ARE YOU?!

00:02:03.244 --> 00:02:07.074
I don't need to hear your opinion;
I already know what it is!

00:02:07.074 --> 00:02:11.035
Oh, boy. What a day,
what a day, what a day...

00:02:11.035 --> 00:02:12.801
Well, that thing ran off.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:16.499
That's about the first good thing
that's happened since I got here.

00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:18.599
So, what's the story on this guy?

00:02:18.599 --> 00:02:22.653
Was he killed by the monster
or did he just... fall?

00:02:22.653 --> 00:02:26.155
You know, that other researcher
was hanging half on the ledge,

00:02:26.155 --> 00:02:28.896
like he was just fucking dumped there.

00:02:28.896 --> 00:02:35.199
I have a theory: we may have sent a LOT
of researchers out here... like, hundreds.

00:02:35.199 --> 00:02:39.210
We didn't really know where to
point the teleporter so we just guessed?

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.202
I'm not seeing too many
because look around.

00:02:42.202 --> 00:02:44.822
The odds of hitting one of these
islands out of this...

00:02:44.822 --> 00:02:48.208
gaseous cloud is kind of slim.

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:51.701
Oh, is that another teleporter?
Oh, that would be perfect! Yeah!

00:02:52.554 --> 00:02:53.841
[screaming]

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.316
Christ...

00:02:55.316 --> 00:02:58.200
Hey, this isn't a teleporter;
it's just a puddle!

00:02:59.438 --> 00:03:01.394
What are YOU looking at?

00:03:01.394 --> 00:03:03.755
Stupid aliens...

00:03:03.755 --> 00:03:05.038
Hup!

00:03:05.038 --> 00:03:05.629
Oof!

00:03:05.629 --> 00:03:08.020
Well, better than the other way.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.732
But yeah, I bet it was raining
researchers all over the place.

00:03:11.732 --> 00:03:12.885
That would explain why there have been

00:03:12.885 --> 00:03:16.105
random batteries and
first aid kits lying around.

00:03:16.105 --> 00:03:18.334
They probably got scattered in the falls.

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:22.488
Oh, God! Is there no other around?

00:03:22.488 --> 00:03:24.550
[sighs]

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.215
Well, I'm out of rockets!

00:03:26.215 --> 00:03:30.297
I guess I'll go with the MP5;
it has the grenade launcher.

00:03:30.297 --> 00:03:32.982
I don't understand how
that thing is still alive!

00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:36.999
I've taken down TANKS with the
firepower I've blasted into it.

00:03:36.999 --> 00:03:41.433
That thing didn't look like a cyborg.
I didn't see any armored plating.

00:03:41.433 --> 00:03:43.747
Hey, what was it that
guy in the lab said?

00:03:43.747 --> 00:03:47.608
There's some sort of creature,
I'll know when I see it?

00:03:47.608 --> 00:03:48.963
Well, I found it.

00:03:48.963 --> 00:03:53.352
So, if I kill it, does that mean that
they'll teleport me back? That'd be nice.

00:03:53.352 --> 00:03:54.951
No. They won't.

00:03:54.951 --> 00:03:55.801
What's this?

00:03:56.344 --> 00:03:58.791
Oh my God, there are rockets in here!

00:03:58.791 --> 00:04:01.799
This brings me closer to my
comfort zone.

00:04:01.799 --> 00:04:04.314
But, yeah, they're not going to
teleport me back.

00:04:04.314 --> 00:04:06.053
This was a one-way trip.

00:04:06.053 --> 00:04:07.921
[rumbling sound]
Just like all the others.

00:04:07.921 --> 00:04:09.834
[screaming]

00:04:10.759 --> 00:04:13.171
I didn't expect that!

00:04:13.171 --> 00:04:15.737
Oh... shit.

00:04:15.737 --> 00:04:21.388
Well NOW would be a great time
for it to NOT charge.

00:04:21.388 --> 00:04:24.072
How is this thing alive?

00:04:24.072 --> 00:04:26.302
I need one of those
mech-suits like in Alien

00:04:26.302 --> 00:04:28.788
so where I can just throw
it off into the void.

00:04:28.788 --> 00:04:33.337
I'd need a lot of mass, though; this
thing really throws its weight around.

00:04:33.337 --> 00:04:37.555
Yeah, that's good.
You just... stay there.

00:04:37.555 --> 00:04:39.739
I have a present for you.

00:04:39.739 --> 00:04:44.434
As the Ambassador of Earth, I wish to
give you this gift on behalf of my people.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.318
Actually, I have a few,
you can have all of them.

00:04:48.318 --> 00:04:51.508
It's what my planet would've
wanted, I'm sure of it.

00:04:51.508 --> 00:04:54.135
But, more importantly,
it's what I want.

00:04:54.135 --> 00:04:57.553
I guess I'm not really the best
ambassador come to think of it,

00:04:57.553 --> 00:04:59.528
but, hey, I'm all you get.

00:04:59.528 --> 00:05:04.052
Okay, now just keep standing there; this is
a very important part of the ceremony.

00:05:04.052 --> 00:05:07.410
We have to get the photos
and attend the luncheon...

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.000
All right, say cheese!

00:05:10.071 --> 00:05:12.167
Diplomacy breaks out!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.801
NO! STAY THERE! YOU'LL RUIN THE SHOT!

00:05:16.598 --> 00:05:17.914
IS THIS A JOKE?!

00:05:17.914 --> 00:05:19.200
WHAT'S HAPPENING?!

00:05:20.665 --> 00:05:21.567
[screaming]

00:05:22.502 --> 00:05:25.012
NOTHING'S IMMUNE TO EXPLOSIVES!

00:05:25.012 --> 00:05:26.651
Oh, shit! I'm out!

00:05:26.651 --> 00:05:28.110
IS THIS A GOD?!

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.232
AM I FIGHTING GOD?!

00:05:30.232 --> 00:05:32.167
IS THIS WHAT GOD LOOKS LIKE?!

00:05:35.405 --> 00:05:35.968
Blah!

00:05:36.412 --> 00:05:38.667
This isn't what I pictured at all!

00:05:39.641 --> 00:05:41.210
YEAH! LEAVE ME ALONE!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.162
I'M A SINNER! WHATEVER!

00:05:43.162 --> 00:05:45.942
I'M NOT READY FOR YOUR TRUTH!

00:05:45.942 --> 00:05:47.879
DID YOU HEAR ME?!

00:05:47.879 --> 00:05:49.818
Oh, you're going to
throw things at me?!

00:05:49.818 --> 00:05:51.801
FINE! I'LL THROW THINGS AT YOU!

00:05:52.669 --> 00:05:54.128
NO! NO!

00:05:54.128 --> 00:05:55.200
DON'T--!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:55.734
NO!

00:05:56.908 --> 00:05:59.056
WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

00:05:59.056 --> 00:06:01.227
THEOLOGISTS DON'T KNOW WHAT
THEY'RE TALKING ABOUT!

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:03.234
NONE OF THE MAJOR RELIGIONS COVER THIS!

00:06:04.787 --> 00:06:06.234
NOT EVEN CLOSE!

00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:11.317
NO-NO-NO-NO-NO!

00:06:11.317 --> 00:06:16.567
Ah! I don't like where this is going;
I'll eventually run out of ammo!

00:06:19.016 --> 00:06:20.463
But you'll--Ah!

00:06:20.463 --> 00:06:21.334
Ah!

00:06:21.783 --> 00:06:24.834
But you'll never run out of
being an alien!

00:06:27.872 --> 00:06:33.660
A wise man once said,
"Jesus Tap-Dancing Christ."

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.103
Y'know, I have a new theory:

00:06:36.103 --> 00:06:41.728
I think, instead of teleporting me, maybe
the scientists just blew up the universe.

00:06:41.728 --> 00:06:44.787
We found a way to do it
--we were really motivated--

00:06:44.787 --> 00:06:48.509
but since I was wearing
this suit, I survived

00:06:48.509 --> 00:06:52.185
and that's why all I see are
other people wearing this suit

00:06:52.185 --> 00:06:56.567
and the laws of reality and everything
else just got scrambled a little bit?

00:06:57.645 --> 00:06:58.200
Whup!

00:06:59.208 --> 00:07:04.068
No, that can't be right. Then my
weapons wouldn't still be here.

00:07:04.068 --> 00:07:04.868
What?

00:07:05.582 --> 00:07:07.294
Oh. Hello.

00:07:07.294 --> 00:07:08.726
Oh, wait, that's right.

00:07:08.726 --> 00:07:11.334
Sorry. I'm a little out of it.

00:07:12.579 --> 00:07:14.158
Hold still.

00:07:14.158 --> 00:07:15.367
Ow! Fuck...

00:07:16.012 --> 00:07:19.033
Yeah, I'm pretty sure the
universe still exists.

00:07:20.916 --> 00:07:24.402
That's kind of too bad
because the alternatives...

00:07:24.402 --> 00:07:25.717
What's this?

00:07:25.717 --> 00:07:27.422
Rockets!

00:07:27.422 --> 00:07:32.653
I kind of hope I don't need these; they're
giving me nothing but bad memories.

00:07:32.653 --> 00:07:37.081
Oh, a pad thing, huh? That's
convenient in a pain-in-the-ass way.

00:07:37.081 --> 00:07:37.916
Bwah!

00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:38.601
Ow!

00:07:40.247 --> 00:07:40.934
OW!

00:07:41.911 --> 00:07:43.456
Don't TOUCH me!

00:07:43.456 --> 00:07:46.236
I'd burn this whole
place down if I could.

00:07:46.236 --> 00:07:50.654
And is there REALLY no other way
besides THIS cave?!

00:07:50.654 --> 00:07:52.020
THIS CAVE?!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:54.025
[growling]

00:07:54.025 --> 00:07:56.382
Hey, that rock's levitating.

00:07:56.382 --> 00:07:57.906
It's not even spinning.

00:07:57.906 --> 00:08:01.054
All those explosives didn't
cause any air currents?

00:08:01.054 --> 00:08:06.008
Y'know, I got these rockets off the dead
guys; maybe they're just dummy rounds.

00:08:06.008 --> 00:08:09.444
After all, if we had hundreds of
researchers falling from the sky,

00:08:09.444 --> 00:08:12.597
you don't want to equip all of
them. That's a waste.

00:08:12.597 --> 00:08:16.050
Yeah, those scientists aren't
going to teleport me back.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.670
I mean, for starters, I'd beat
the shit out of them.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:23.451
I might kill them, I don't know.
It depends on what they would say.

00:08:23.451 --> 00:08:26.100
Well, so far, so not dead.

00:08:28.316 --> 00:08:29.859
Fuck bubbles...

00:08:29.859 --> 00:08:31.583
Oh, it's running!

00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:34.810
Good! I like-- Whoa! Kind of slick.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:37.646
No! I'm sliding! NOOO!

00:08:37.646 --> 00:08:41.033
Oh, that's right. Low gravity.
This is still shit.

00:08:42.592 --> 00:08:46.236
GOD! GET OFF MY FACE!
YOU'RE LIKE HOPPING LEECHES!

00:08:46.236 --> 00:08:49.096
WHAT?! ENJOYING THE SHOW?!

00:08:49.096 --> 00:08:51.987
HEY, I'VE GOT SOME LEFT!

00:08:51.987 --> 00:08:53.801
MAY AS WELL USE THEM, RIGHT?!

00:08:55.231 --> 00:08:58.334
Oh! That was a good one!
Hey, I've got one more!

00:08:59.392 --> 00:09:01.067
Yeah! Oh, fuck!

00:09:02.286 --> 00:09:03.959
STAY ON YOUR SIDE!

00:09:03.959 --> 00:09:06.989
THAT'S YOUR SIDE! STAY ON YOUR SIDE!

00:09:06.989 --> 00:09:08.747
Shit! Shit!

00:09:08.747 --> 00:09:10.249
Oh, did I--?

00:09:10.249 --> 00:09:12.117
Pluh! No!

00:09:12.117 --> 00:09:13.257
Yes!

00:09:13.257 --> 00:09:13.876
No!

00:09:13.876 --> 00:09:15.722
God! Stop it!

00:09:15.722 --> 00:09:17.587
Christ, I can't see!

00:09:17.587 --> 00:09:19.176
Where--?!

00:09:19.176 --> 00:09:20.442
BLAAAAAAAAH!

00:09:20.442 --> 00:09:22.822
GOD! GET ME OUT OF HERE! ANYTHING!

00:09:22.822 --> 00:09:24.667
[fzzt]
What?!

